	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Certum est <placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName> remisisse legatos suos<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Zu deren Namen s. <ref target="file12897">Nr. 2848</ref>, Anm. 27. Sie leisteten Kaiser <persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName> den Fußfall am Abfassungstag des vorliegenden Briefes; s. <ref target="file12871">Nr. 2822</ref>, Anm. 16.</note> ante dies 12, ut componant <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>cum cęsare.<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note></s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quid interea actum sit, nescimus.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Postquam autem venerunt nuncii de <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>15 millibus in duobus proeliis interfectis ab electore<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Kurfürst <persName ref="p19065">Johann Friedrich I. von Sachsen</persName>. - Zu diesen zwei Schlachten s. <ref target="file12897">Nr. 2848</ref>, Anm. 33.</note>, et a <placeName ref="l2655">civitatibus maritimis</placeName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Siehe dazu <ref target="file12899">Nr. 2850</ref>,22f.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>miserunt<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Subjekt sind die <placeName ref="l491">Straßburger</placeName> Ratsherren.</note> protinus cursorem equestrem<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Unbekannt. - Vermutlich ein falsches Gerücht.</note> ad legatos cęsarem sequentes, ut, si pactio <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>nondum sit facta, eam suspendant et differant pro virili, donec aliter edoce<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>antur.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Heri venit veredarius<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Unbekannt.</note> <persName ref="p20225">Galli</persName>.<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">König <persName ref="p20225">Franz I.</persName></note></s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quid adtulerit, ignoro.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Postridie summo <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>mane abiit festinanter <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName> una cum ducibus duobus.<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Unbekannt. -Die <placeName ref="l491">Straßburger</placeName> hatten eine Zeitlang eine Annäherung mit <placeName ref="l832">Frankreich</placeName> gesucht; s. <ref target="file12880">Nr. 2831</ref>, Anm. 4.</note></s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Rumor: regem pro <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ipsis collecturum exercitum, tantum ne se dedant cęsari.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Scripsisti tu plausibilia<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Bezug auf <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Mitteilung in <ref target="file12899">Nr. 2850</ref>,3-9, zu dem bei <placeName ref="l2396">Rochlitz</placeName> errungenen Sieg des Kurfürsten über Markgraf <persName ref="p18422">Albrecht II. Alcibiades von Brandenburg-Kulmbach</persName>; s. <ref target="file12881">Nr. 2832</ref>, Anm. 35.</note>, quamvis cęsareani dicant omnia ficta, adeo dolet eis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>malum vel somniare de cęsare.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Fuit hic <placeName ref="l15">Antwerpiensis</placeName>.<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Unbekannt. - Zu den hier übermittelten Nachrichten vgl. schon Nr. 2854; <ref target="file12908">Nr. 2859</ref>,28-30.</note></s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Is narravit quatuor naves venisse <placeName ref="l15">Antwerpiam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>onustas auro et argento contra <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Id, quia verisimile non est, non credo: <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>nec <persName ref="p20225">Gallus</persName> enim nec <persName ref="p3207">Anglus</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p3207">Eduard VI.</persName></note> permisissent (hostes cęsaris)<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Klammern</hi> ergänzt.</note> naves transire;<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Nämlich durch den <placeName ref="l2757">Ärmelkanal</placeName>, um in den Hafen von <placeName ref="l15">Antwerpen</placeName> zu gelangen.</note> et cęsar <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>aurum invehit in <placeName ref="l875">Hispaniam</placeName>, non evehit!<pb type="edition" next="439"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Quam vero dissideant <persName ref="p19981">papa</persName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><persName ref="p19981">Paul III.</persName></note> et cęsar, annon patet, quod novum exercitum hic <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>petit ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName>!<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">In Bezug auf <ref target="file12899">Nr. 2850</ref>,13-15. - <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName>' Aussage ist ironisch aufzufassen; vgl. auch <ref target="file12898">Nr. 2849</ref>,14-16.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Oremus dominum, imperatorem nostrum, ut et ipse producat ali<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quando suas copias contra hostes verbis sui.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in Christo.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis <persName ref="p8011">Gval<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>therum</persName> et reliquos pios fratres.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Plura nec habui nec potui.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> raptim, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>21. martii anno 1547.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8418">Os. M.</persName></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, episcopo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, fratri in domino <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
